            "description": {
              "content": "First step of the dopost media upload workflow: request a presigned URL by\ndeclaring the file you intend to upload. The response includes a `mediaId`\nand an upload `url` to PUT the file bytes to. Documented as a three-step\nflow (request presigned URL, upload file, finalize).\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
